    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00471",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "女人笑了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The woman laughed.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00471",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "既像调情，又像难为情。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It seemed both flirtatious and embarrassed.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00471",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "实在太唐突了，以致他一下子来不及反应。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It was so sudden that he could not react at once.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00471",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "她究竟在打什么算盘？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "What on earth was she scheming?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00471",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "……是故意的吗，还是手情不自禁地打起滑来了呢？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "...Was it deliberate, or had her hand slipped of its own accord?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00471",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "……刚刚还是睡眼惺忪，好容易才把她弄醒，可这会儿……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "...Just a moment ago she had still been heavy with sleep, and he had barely managed to wake her, but now...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00471",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "这么说来，第一天晚上，和她擦身而过时，碰到了侧腹，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Come to think of it, on the first night, when he brushed past her and touched her side,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00471",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "女人也发出了怪笑声……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "the woman had let out a strange laugh then too...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00471",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "那个动作，对女人来说，有什么特殊的意味吧？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Did that gesture have some special meaning for the woman?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
